## 4. Technical Stack & Architectural Guidelines

* **Framework:** Next.js (App Router preferred)
* **Styling:** CSS Modules or Tailwind CSS (no external component frameworks like MUI or AntD).
* **Platform Priority:** Desktop-First Web App.
* **Data Storage / Mocking:** Initial phase can use local state / mock JSON fixtures for risk evaluation and PDF parsing routines before full backend/database wiring.

---

## 5. Non-Functional Requirements & Interactive States

* **Loading UI:** Display custom SVG loader during PDF parsing or goal calculation with context text (*"Evaluating cash flow safety margins..."*).
* **Error Handling:** Form fields must show inline validation. PDF upload failures or unsupported formats must trigger top-anchored banner notifications.
* **Performance:** PDF parsing or goal calculation visual feedback must render in under 2 seconds.

---

## 6. Out of Scope for Phase 1
* Multi-currency conversion (US Dollar default).
* Complex interactive chart libraries (keep tables and card-based metrics primary).
* Native mobile apps (web application only).